<title>CANADA: CanOxy completes C$100 mln debenture issue.</title>
<headline>CanOxy completes C$100 mln debenture issue.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Occidental Petroleum Ltd said on Friday it completed its issue of C$100 million principle amount of unsecured debentures.</p>
<p>CanOxy said proceeds from the debentures, which carry a coupon of 6.85 percent and mature November 15, 2006, will be used to repay short-term debt.</p>
<p>An underwriting group including RBC Dominion Securities Inc, TD Securities Inc and CIBC Wood Gundy Inc purchased the debentures for public distribution. -- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
